<title>BELGIUM: Luxembourg Hypobank International opens web site.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg Hypobank International opens web site.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hypobank International SA Luxembourg, a unit of Munich-based Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG, has become the latest of the Grand Duchy's banks to open an Internet site.</p>
<p>The site (http://www.hypolux.lu) gives information about the bank's history and products in German.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
